The MIT license above covers the lame_mp3 plugin's own code: everything in
this package except the LAME files in src/lame/.

src/lame/ contains the LAME MP3 encoder library (libmp3lame 4.0,
https://lame.sourceforge.io), Copyright (c) 1999-2011 The LAME Project and
others (see src/lame/README and the individual source files). It is licensed
under the GNU Library General Public License, version 2 or (at your option)
any later version (LGPL-2.0-or-later); see src/lame/COPYING and
src/lame/LICENSE. The native library built from src/ (liblame_mp3.so on
Android, lame_mp3.framework on iOS) contains LAME and is therefore distributed
under the LGPL. Of the files in src/lame/, only config.h and PATCHES.md were
written for this plugin; they are covered by the MIT license above.
